 *   └─────────┬────────────┘
 *             │
 *             ▼
 *   ┌─────────┐
 *   │ rerank   │  → cz_ranked, ez_ranked (pass-through from service)
 *   └────┬────┘
 *        │
 *        ▼
 *   ┌────────────┐
 *   │ mix_policy  │  → policy, upstream_trace
 *   └─────┬──────┘
 *         │
 *         ▼
 *   ┌──────────────┐
 *   │ build_cards   │  → cards (core output)
 *   └──────┬───────┘
 *          │
 *          ▼
 *   ┌────────────────────┐
 *   │ explain_from_trace  │  → explanation, bullets (LLM-generated)
